r existido una civilización en el bosque, las ruinas deberían seguir ahí, ¿no?"�Además, Uxie es un Pokémon conocido por habitar en lagos.\nSi bien es cierto que en el bosque hay uno, nadie lo ha visto en siglos."g¿Quizá borra la memoria de todo aquel que lo haya visto?\n¿O simplemente serán todo patrañas?"~Ni siquiera se sabe a ciencia cierta qué era exactamente esa reliquia ni qué efecto tenía... \n¡Es todo muy extraño!"GBueno, muchacho.\nMe alegro de haber compartido este rato contigo."GBueno, muchacha.\nMe alegro de haber compartido este rato contigo."�Si alguna vez te encuentras con algún viajero como yo que tenga algo que contar, no dudes en escucharle.\n¡Nuestras historias son las mejores!"4Oh, está bien.\n¡Nos vemos por ahí, viajero!"G\tg[Simon]Los molinos siguen en marcha...\nY la central tiene luz."�\tg[Simon]No tienen excusa.\nSea quien sea que esté jugueteando con el suministro eléctrico, se va a enterar de lo que vale un peine."\tg[Owen]Eh, profesor..."N\tg[Simon]¡AAAAAH!\NMaldición, si solo son pelo-Zanama y pelo-Tamato..."M\tg[Simon]¡AAAAAH!\NMaldición, si solo son pelo-Zanama y pelo-Pinia..."�\tg[Owen]<fs=20>¿Ahora también llama a \PN así...?</fs>\NProfesor Simon, creo haber visto a unos tipos muy sospechosos por aquí antes."�\tg[Owen]<fs=20>¿Ahora también tiene un mote para \PN...?</fs>\NProfesor Simon, creo haber visto a unos tipos muy sospechosos por aquí antes."t\tg[Owen]Es bastante probable que fueran ellos los culpables.\nAunque igual deberíamos llamar a la policía..."H\tg[Simon]¡Bah!\nQuedaos aquí, esto lo soluciono yo bien rápido."(\tg[Owen]¡Ah!\N¡Espere, profesor!"¡Claro!"No, tengo prisa[0"East -> Lucerne Forest"@ Hello, my friend!\n Don't you have a battle on your hands?"@ Hello, my friend!\n Don't you have a battle on your hands?")It's my bag's fault, it's too heavy!") What's in my bag?\nHeh, heh, heh..."#I must not go any further yet!"You caught the Purrloin!"2You got the bracelet back! Time to return it."I think we have enough."KWhat's taking so long?\nit can't be that hard to catch those Pokémon!"(Hello!\nHave you used berry plants?"=If you use mulch, they will grow even faster.\nHave one!"MIt never hurts to pick some berries.\nWho knows when they may be needed!"-They are more slippery than I thought...">Hello, hello!\nWhat are you doing here at this hour, boy?"?Hello, hello!\nWhat are you doing here at this hour, girl?"MCome, sit down!\nI always have a story or two to tell by campfire light."rI will tell you about the legend of Lucerne Forest. \nDid you know that this place is closely linked to Uxie?"�The story goes that, long ago, a civilization of Pokémon and humans inhabited the forest depths.\nAt that time, both species lived in complete harmony."Uxie is known as the being of wisdom. \nTo share its gift with others, it gave up part of its power in the form of an heirloom."�However, when the strong bonds between Pokémon and humans began to dissipate, Uxie was forced to retrieve the relic and hide it from the men."�They say that, should it find someone who can reaffirm the ties between humans and Pokémon once again, Uxie would open the way to them and give them its gift."EInteresting, don't you think?\nIt is a legend told by travelers."�Although, to be honest, it's kind of hard to believe.\nFor starters, if there was a civilization in the forest, the ruins should still be there, right?"�In addition, Uxie is a Pokémon known to inhabit lakes.\nWhile it is true that there is one in the forest, no one has seen it for centuries."YMaybe it erases the memory of everyone who has seen it?\nOr is it all just nonsense?"oIt is not even known for sure what exactly that relic was or what effect it had.... \nIt's all so strange!"?Well, my boy.\nI'm glad to have shared this time with you."=Well, girl.\nI'm glad to have shared this time with you."~If you ever come across a traveler like me who has something to say, don't hesitate to listen.\nOur stories are the best!".Oh, all right.\nSee you ar