is!"W\tg[Owen]Ah...\nThey keep pulling those mysterious little screens out of thin air!"[\tg[Metis Recruit]Vikavolt!\nTake care of them for us, like the good friends we are..."\tg[Vikavolt]Bzzzzzzt!"h\tg[Owen]Friends, you say!?\nThat Pokémon looks like anything but your friend! You are forcing it!"2\tg[Owen]\PN, get ready!\nThis one is strong!"5\tg[Metis Recruit]Vikavolt!\nHow could you fail?"N\tg[Metis Recruit]N-no...!\nThe energy we had stolen for Headquarters...!"I\tg[Owen]So that's what you were using the Charjabug for!\nRuthless!"9\tg[Metis Recruit]Grrr...\nWe won't forget this one."u\tg[Metis Recruit]We must inform the higher-ups as soon as possible.\nGet out of the way, you meddling bastards!"O\tg[Simon]Are you okay?\nI've been waiting at the entrance the whole time."�\tg[Simon]I was almost run over by a stampede of Charjabug and trampled by a group of members of that Corporation...\nDamn it, I couldn't stop them!"�\tg[Owen]Well, at least it seems that we've prevented them from sabotaging the plant.\nIt's all thanks to you \PN, luckily you were with me."Y\tg[Simon]I see.\nThe light should have returned to the town and the academy by now."d\tg[Simon]Come with me, both of you, I have something to talk about.\nEspecially with you, \PN."&You've already pulled this lever."$Huh?\nWhat are you doing here!?"B-but you're just kids!"HI don't know how you got this far, but you'd better stop right now."E\tg[Simon]What are you doing here!?\nI told you to stay outside!"f\tg[Owen]Well, but... What if they turn out to be crooks?\nYou'd better get all the help you can!",\tg[Simon]Help...?\NYou mean hindrance!"6\tg[???]What's going on?\nHas someone broken in!?"\tg[???]Aaah!\nIntruders!"S\tg[???]Recruit, the electric barrier, quick! \nOr everything will go to hell!""\tg[Owen]Ah!\nThere they are!"1\tg[Owen]Hey, you! What\nare you guys up to?",\tg[Owen]T-the barrier!\nWe're trapped!"N\tg[???]You bastards!\nYou dare to interfere with the Metis Corporation?!"\tg[Simon]Ngh...\