stema.")¡Desbloqueado el acceso a Despejar!"�\tg[Simon]La habilidad Despejar te permite disipar cúmulos de niebla que puedan estar ocultando objetos o incluso nuevos caminos de tu campo de visión."`\tg[Simon]Para usarla, basta con presionar la tecla M en un lugar con niebla.\nEso es todo."u¡Se han desbloqueado más favores!\nPuedes echar un vistazo a los que están disponibles en el Menú - Favores."Vamos allá"Tengo que prepararme"Sí"No[r"�The fog becomes even stronger on Route 17.\nIt is very dangerous to travel because you will also have to cross cliffs over the sea."�The few people who manage to do it affirm that beyond there is nothing, only the border with the neighboring region and a very high mountain."5\tg[Owen]Aha!\nLooks like I beat you to it, \PN."�\tg[Owen]We have finally reached Quartz City. \nThis is where ex-Champion Lilliana lives and where daily tournaments are held between all kinds of trainers."�\tg[Owen]I was just on my way to the Castle to participate in today's tournament.\nI imagine since Lilliana will be there we can also question her about Metis Corp.."{\tg[Owen]Hmm\..\..\..\nAlthough maybe I should buy some items first, I've heard that the tournament battles are tough."J\tg[Owen]Go ahead, \PN.\NHeliolisk and I will stop by the shop first."o\tg[Elliot]Do you mind if we go find Azelf first, \PN?\NThere's\..\..\..something I have to do over there."�\tg[Elliot]In fact, could you walk me to the house on <b>Route 10</b> first, before I get to Anatasa City?\nYou know, where I took Archen when he was injured."�\tg[Elliot]I want to know if he's still around and he's okay, I lost sight of him when a member of the Metis Corp. kidnapped me and took me to Lilliana.\nI hope nothing happened to him in the cold weather\...\..\. ."`Patrolling this city is easy except in the mornings.\nThe fog doesn't let you see anything!"�The aesthetics of Quartz City have been maintained for many years.\nAgate City, the other major city in the region, did modernize its buildings and has a completely different atmosphere."�People complain that they've stopped selling repels but what I want is to find myself with even more Pokémon to train.THere, in case you need it."�I have a theory that it's actually a normal flute but people don't know how to play it well.\nThe noises are so scary that the Pokémon come out to attack you to put them out of their misery."eCan you believe that the pirates of the north still exist?\nNot like in the old days, of course."�Today's "pirates" are trainers who sail the seas with their Pokémon.\nThey go looking for opponents to challenge to become something they call a "Punmaster."\nIf you want more details on that, maybe someone from Lapis Village can give them to you."G\tg[Alba]My mother is acting weird...\nI mean, weirder than usual."d\tg[Alba]I hope she's not up to anything.\nWe have to get Jeremiah, Teresa and the others back."�What's the matter, looking for problems?\nFind yourself a math book, I'm too busy counting the shells I found the other day on the beach."!Take one and leave me, okay?"AOne little shell, two little shells\..\..\..\nHeh, heh, heh."+Quartz City - The impeccable port city"VOh, the sounds of the sea are really relaxing!\nI could spend the whole day here."�Visit the aquarium if you're interested in Water-type Pokémon.\nThey have a wide variety of species and I've even heard they're looking for new additions.";It's a Pokémon from... from... from KANTOOOOOOOOOOOO."�Are you going to sign up for the Castle tournament?\nPrepare well, most of the participants have been trained by Lilliana herself!"~\tg[???]Excuse me, beautiful.\nIt seems my Glameow got a little nervous at the sight of yours, and I had to find out why."B\tg[Girl]Eh?\nIt seems to me that it's acting normal\..\..\.."q\tg[???]I-I'm telling you, he's very nervous, I know him well.\nYou must be a cat Pokémon lover too, right?"J\tg[Girl]No, not really.\nI'm just walking my grandmother's Pokémon."M\tg[Girl]Do you need anything, or can I go now?\nThey're waiting for me."K\tg[???]N-no, wait!\nDid you know I'm one of Lilliana's castle guards?"�\tg[???]Quite a professional, in fact. \nI'm about to be promoted for my great work protecting spectators in tournaments alongside my mighty Bronzong."Y\tg[???]Isn't that impressive?\nHow about we take a walk together and I'll show you?"U\tg[Girl]A Bronzong, did you say?\nAnd why are you here walking a Glameow, then?"Y\tg[???]O-orders from Lilliana, of course. \nTurns out this is her personal Glameow!"A\tg[Girl]You're a liar.\nA moment ago you said it was yours!"-\tg[???]T-this\..\..\..\nYes, of course."S\tg[???]It's just that she gave it to me.\nI'm one of her best men, after all."G\tg[Chica]Screw you.\nYou're not a clown, you're the whole circus."'\tg[Girl]Huh?\nWhat's up, Glameow?"N\tg[Girl]They are my favorite Pokémon.\nI never thought I would see one."F\tg[Girl]Excuse me, what's your name?\nDo you come from far away?"6\tg[Girl]Ah, so you are \PN!\NThat's a good name!"w\tg[Girl]Hey, wouldn't you like to go for a walk with my Glameow and me?\nI want to know more about your Pokémon."A\tg[Girl]If you can't, no problem.\nWe can meet another day."Z\tg[Girl]Oh, but you're not from around here, I guess.\nAre you challenging the gyms?"p\tg[Girl]Wow, that's great!\nI would also like to travel around the region sometime and get all the badges!"�\tg[Girl]Ever since I was little I've always wanted to leave the city and see the world.\nBut I have to take care of my grandmother, so I haven't had a chance\..\..\.."v\tg[Girl]Hey, promise me you'll come back sometime!\nI'll treat you to some delicious cookies, I'm great at them!">\tg[Girl]Now I have to go.\nDon't forget, it's a promise!"\tg[???]N-no, wait! \ NNO!"W\tg[???]\wtnp[]NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO"W\tg[???]\wtnp[]OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO"+\tg[???]YOU!!\nThis is all your fault!"H\tg[???]I almost had it!\NI've had