ro?\nEs una auténtica maestra de los motes."�\tg[Ciara]Fue una de mis principales inspiraciones a la hora de combatir.\nSiento que igual debería fijarme mejor en sus poses\..\..\..["=\tg[Ciara]Who is a handsome Pokémon?\nYou are, you are!"6\tg[Ciara]Puchi, Puchi, Puchi!\what a...\.na\.da!"\tg[Ciara]A-ah!\nAhem."r\tg[Ciara]Welcome to the shadows, challenger!\nFirst of all, know that I owe you a debt for finding my Puchi."r\tg[Ciara]Welcome to the shadows, challenger!\nFirst of all, know that I owe you a debt for finding my Puchi."z\tg[Ciara]I sent a couple of my friends to give him a ride and look what they did to him.\nWhat irresponsible people!"#\tg[Ciara]\..\..\..\n\..\..\.."U\tg[Ciara]Ah, you're saying it wasn't his fault?\nThat a Banette kidnapped him!?"6\tg[Ciara]Oh\..\..\..\nCould it be that\..\..\..?"f\tg[Ciara]No, that can't be.\nForget it, the important thing is that Puchi is here with me again."�\tg[Ciara]Let me give you what you came for, it's battle time!\nFrom the darkest of gloom, my Pokémon and I will drag you into the shadows!"�\tg[Ciara]You will tremble at the sight of my powerful Dark-type Pokémon and the intimidating names I have given them!\nThis will be the end of you!"X\tg[Ciara]What was my mistake!?\nMaybe I have to think of better nicknames\..\..\.."r\tg[Ciara]No, I just have to get stronger.\nI think I've been able to learn a lot from you and your Pokémon."?\tg[Ciara]Here, take this.\nA well deserved badge for you!"R\tg[Ciara]Take this TM too.\nIt's my favorite, and my Pokémon love using it!"�\tg[Ciara]The next leader is Dhara, to get to her Gym you'll have to go through Route 12.\nSandstorms are constant there, so be careful!"Z\tg[Ciara]Do you know Met, the boss of the Metro?\nShe is a true master of nicknames."�\tg[Ciara]She was one of my main inspirations when it came to fighting.\nI feel like I should pay more attention to their poses\..\..\..;["J\tg[Ciara]¿Quién es un Pokémon guapo?\n¡Tú lo eres, tú lo eres!">\tg[Ciara]¡Puchi,