\..\n¡Sí, podría probar!"*\tg[Owen]Pft\..\..\..\nPffft\..\..\.."9\tg[Owen]Ah, si no sé silbar.\n¿Puedes probar tú?"7\tg[Owen]¿Gritar?\nSí, puedo intentarlo\..\..\.."\tg[Owen]A ver.\nEjem."_\tg[Owen]¡EEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEH! \N¡AQUÍIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIII!"F\tg[Owen]¡Ah, claro!\nTal vez si les enseño unas bayas\..\..\..">\tg[Owen]¡Pssst!\n¡Dewgong bonitos, mirad lo que tengo!"*\tg[Owen]¡Son bayas!\n¡Muuuy ricas!"3\tg[Owen]¿A que os apetecen?\n¿¡A que sí!?"0\tg[Owen]¡Aaah!\n¡Sin morder, SIN MORDER!"K\tg[Owen]¡Ugh!\n¡Tal vez con una batalla se tranquilicen de una vez!"^\tg[Owen]Vale\..\..\..\nAhora sí que podemos concentrarnos en sacar a esa chica de ahí.";\tg[Owen]¡Adelante, Mantine!\n¡Necesitamos tu ayuda!"\..\..\..\n\..\..\.."¡Claro!"No, tengo prisa".Dijo el que espía por ventanas ajenas..."Silbar"Gritar"Atraerlos con comida[V"|I didn't have enough to think of shit to put in the garbage cans, now I have to think of shit to put in all the chests?"sHello, hello!\nSorry to bother you, would you mind listening to one of my stories by the light of the bonfire?"`I'll give you something very interesting if you do.\nThat's all this lonely hiker asks for!"'Oh, that's fine.\nSome other time!"�Have you heard of the legends that are told in Esoteria about the past of the region? \nPokémon and humans lived as equals\..\..\.."�But there was a human who betrayed the Pokémon and began to use a strange power to capture them.\nThat's when they stopped trusting people and ran away."�The source of that power that was used were some relics that the Pokémon themselves had given to humans as a symbol of friendship and peace.\nIronic, isn't it?"{A Jewel, a Sword, and a Mirror.\nAfter a tough battle between humans and Pokémon, they were finally able to retrieve them."oThe three guardians, Uxie, Mesprit and Azelf took them away\..\..\..\nAnd they never saw each other again."�The Sword was the relic given to humans by Azelf, the Pokémon that lives in these cold parts.\nOr so they say, because they have never seen it around here again."�Even ex-Champion Lilliana tried searching for it a long time ago, to no avail.\nIt is said that it will only appear again to humans who know how to truly value Pokémon."{But\..\..\..\nThey didn't completely lose faith in us, as the three Pokémon left behind an item that would help find them."UIt is a Radiant Amulet\..\..\..\NWhich has also been lost for a long, long time."tSome say that it was first found by some villagers\..\..\..\nThen it passed into the hands of some rich people."�Finally they passed into the hands of thieves\..\..\.. \nAnd maybe it was even considered a treasure and they hid it beyond the sea."DInteresting, don't you think?\nIt's a legend told by travelers."[But I didn't make you listen to all this just because.\nHere, I want you to have this."NIt's an old map.\nIt probably indicates the exact location of the Amulet."UI think someone like you will know what to do with it better than me.\nHa ha ha!"[Thank you very much for listening.\nI missed being able to share legends with someone."If you ever come across a traveler like me who has something to tell, don't hesitate to listen.\nOur stories are the best!"&Your favor list has been updated!"aIt's a very old map.\nIf you know a cartographer they might be able to help you decipher it."f\tg[Phantasmaniac]You found me\..\..\..\nI am one\..\..\.. of the Hex Maniacs!\nPadoru, padoru..."a\tg[Phantasmaniac]I... lost.\nDon't tell my brother from Beryl Village, heh heh heh\..\..\.."J\tg[???]I've been stupid.\nThose guys aren't even worth my attention."6\tg[???]It can't be.\nAnd what's wrong with you!?"G\tg[???]Maybe my Pokémon will make you stop following me at once!"0\tg[Silver]Mmm.\nYou're strong, I admit it."6\tg[Silver]I'll listen to you.\nWhat do you want?"E\tg[Silver]A gift from my mo-\...\...\... \nI mean, from Athena?"$\tg[Silver]\..\..\..\n\..\..\.."(\tg[Silver]Is it\..\..\..\nA scarf?"V\tg[Silver]Is she blind!?\nI'm already wearing a scarf, I don't need another one!">\tg[Silver]Although\..\..\..\nThis one is softer\..\..\.."@\tg[Silver]Okay!\nTell her I've accepted her blissful gift!"G\tg[Silver]And next time don't send a stalker to deliver it to me!"J\tg[Silver]Are you kidding me?\nIf you want a fight, you'll have one!"J\tg[Silver]\..\..\..\nAs soon as I heal my Pokémon again, of course."K\tg[Silver]I wouldn't mind fighting you again one day.\nYou're strong."�\tg[Silver]You remind me of my riv-\..\..\..\nA guy I used to run into in Johto from time to time and who always made it very difficult for me in battle.":\tg[Owen]Concentrate, Alba!\nAnd leave my lock alone!"2North - Anatase City\nSouth - Adamantite Mine"/\tg[Elliot]\PN...\NWhat happened... to me?"?\tg[Elliot]Oh yeah!\nI fell into the lake and found Azelf!"'\tg[Elliot]A-archen!\nYou're fine!"F\tg[Elliot]I was so worried.\nGood thing nothing happened to you!"&Elliot tells you what happened..."0\tg[Elliot]And...\nThis is what he gave me."7\tg[Elliot]How is Alba doing?\nHas she found Uxie?"a\tg[Elliot]We should go to Lucerna Forest to see how she's doing.\nShe might need some help."K\tg[Alba]It's just that your lock of hair\..\..\..!\nIt's very unruly!"@To the north - Anatase City\n To the west - Adamantite Mine" \tg[Owen]\PN!\NLook, there!"7\tg[Owen]Wait\..\..\..\nIsn't that girl\..\..\..!?"&\tg[Alba]Ah!\nNo, leave me alone!"u\tg[Alba]I-I'm telling you, I didn't want to bother you! \nAnd in case you were wondering, I'm not tasty at all!"I\tg[Owen]It\..\..\..\nIt's the tournament girl, Lilliana's daughter!"|\tg[Owen]Mmm\..\..\..\nI can't be the only one who gets the feeling that the Dewgong just want to play with her, right?"K\tg[Owen]And the big question is\..\..\..\nWhat do we do to help her!?"1\tg[Owen]Whistle\..\..\..\nYes, I could try!"*\tg[Owen]Pft\..\..\..\nPffft\..\..\.."<\tg[Owen]Ah, I don't know how to whistle.\nCan you try?",\tg[Owen]Yell?\nYes, I can try\..\..\.."\tg[Owen]Let's see.\nAhem."\\tg[Owen]EEEEEEEEEE