Baton"Forward"Forward"Forward"Forward"Forward"Forward"Forward"Awareness[J0"nThere is a plant seed on its back right from the day this Pokémon is born. The seed slowly grows larger."eWhen the bulb on its back grows large, it appears to lose the ability to stand on its hind legs."_Its plant blooms when it is absorbing solar energy. It stays on the move to seek sunlight."tFrom the time it is born, a flame burns at the tip of its tail. Its life would end if the flame were to go out."cIf it becomes agitated during battle, it spouts intense flames, incinerating its surroundings."�Charizard flies around the sky in search of powerful opponents. It breathes fire of such great heat that it melts anything. However, it never turns its fiery breath on any opponent weaker than itself."�Squirtle's shell is not merely used for protection. The shell's rounded shape and the grooves on its surface help minimize resistance in water, enabling this Pokémon to swim at high speeds."�Its tail is large and covered with a rich, thick fur. The tail becomes increasingly deeper in color as Wartortle ages. The scratches on its shell are evidence of this Pokémon's toughness as a battler."�Blastoise has water spouts that protrude from its shell. The water spouts are very accurate. They can shoot bullets of water with enough accuracy to strike empty cans from a distance of over 160 feet."�Caterpie has a voracious appetite. It can devour leaves bigger than its body right before your eyes. From its antenna, this Pokémon releases a terrifically strong odor."�The shell covering this Pokémon's body is as hard as an iron slab. Metapod does not move very much. It stays still because it is preparing its soft innards for evolution inside the hard shell."�Butterfree has a superior ability to search for delicious honey from flowers. It can even search out, extract, and carry honey from flowers that are blooming over six miles from its nest."�Weedle has an extremely acute sense of smell. It is capable of distinguishing its favorite kinds of leaves from those it dislikes just by sniffing with its big red proboscis (nose)."�Kakuna remains virtually immobile as it clings to a tree. However, on the inside, it is extremely busy as it prepares for its coming evolution. This is evident from how hot the shell becomes to the touch."�Beedrill is extremely territorial. No one should ever approach its nest-this is for their own safety. If angered, they will attack in a furious swarm."�Pidgey has a highly developed sense of direction. Although he is far away from familiar areas, he is able to return to his nest."�It takes control of a very vast territory and flies over it to control it. If they invade his living space, he will have no qualms about attacking with his sharp claws."|It has beautiful and hypnotic plumage. Many trainers are amazed at the feathers on its head and choose it as their Pokémon."�Rattata is cautious as he alone. Even when he sleeps he moves his ears to hear everything that could pose a danger. He digs his burrow anywhere."vRaticate grows strong and firm fangs. To keep them sharp, she gnaws on rocks, logs, and even the walls of houses."�When it chirps, it can be heard for 1 km. If its high-pitched shriek is followed by an echo of sorts, we'll be hearing other Spearow respond to the warning."�It is recognized for having a long neck and beak that allow it to hunt in water and on dry land. It moves its beak skillfully to catch its prey."�It curls up to rest. This position allows it to respond quickly in the event of a threat, since it is enough for it to raise its head fiercely in any direction."�He is tremendously strong and can crush anything with his body, even crushing steel barrels. Once it catches its victim, there is no way to escape."�It has some bags on its cheeks in which it stores electricity. When released suddenly, the power of the discharge is equal to that of lightning."�If it accumulates too much electricity, it becomes violent. To avoid this, he usually discharges excess energy, which keeps him calm."lWhen rolled into a ball, it repels any attack. As it lives in the desert it has a coarse and hard skin."sIt curls up to protect itself from the enemy and from heat strokes during the day, when the temperature rises."�Given its small size, it is believed that it developed the poisonous barbs for protection. When he gets angry, he releases a horrible toxic substance from his horn."�When he is with family or friends, he retracts the spikes so as not to hurt anyone. Apparently, if she is separated from her group, she gets very nervous."�It is covered by very hard scales. She usually throws her rivals into the air by hitting them violently. She defends her young with great ferocity."�The male Nidoran has developed muscles to move his ears and point them in any direction. In this way, it is able to capture even the slightest sound."�It has a horn that is harder than diamond. If he senses a hostile presence, the spikes on his back bristle and he meets the enemy with all his might."�Nidoking's thick tail is destructive. With one shake it can bring down even a transmission tower. When he runs amok, there is no one to stop him."�When there is a full moon, they go out in groups to play. At dawn, the exhausted Clefairys return to their mountain lodges to sleep huddled together."�It uses its wings to jump and walk through the water, but it does not fly. It is known that she loves to walk around the lakes on quiet full moon nights."�He can control fire at will and releases flames from his mouth. It has six tails whose temperature rises radically just before it evolves."nThey say that each of its nine tails has magical powers. Over time, Ninetales' fur takes on a golden hue."�He who hears his song falls asleep. The acoustic waves of his singsong voice couple with the brain waves of the listener and make him fall into a deep sleep."{His skin has a luxurious quality. Sleeping next to a Wigglytuff is wonderful. When he sucks, his size increases enormously."�Due to their time spent in dark caverns, their eyes are atrophied and devoid of vision. They use ultrasonic waves to detect obstacles."�It has fangs that go through the thicker fur. It feeds itself by sucking the blood of people and other Pokémon. It flutters in the dark and attacks from behind."�This Pokémon grows by absorbing moonlight. During the day, it burrows into the ground, leaving only the leaves behind. This prevents enemies from detecting it."�A very noxious honey falls from its mouth, giving off a stench that can cause memory loss. However, there are those who claim to delight in the stench of it."�In the seasons when it produces more pollen, Vileplume dyes the air yellow when walking. The pollen is highly toxic and causes paralysis."�It carries two parasitic mushrooms, called tochukaso, which feed on the nutrients of Paras itself. Mushrooms are used as an elixir of life."�They destroy large trees by absorbing their nutrients. When a plague-stricken tree dies, the Parasect go for the next one instantly."|They say that it evolved with a thin layer of stiff hair for protection. It has such large eyes that no prey goes unnoticed."}It is nocturnal, it only works in the dark. Their favorite food is small insects that congregate at night near light sources."�In many farms they tend to raise them because, wherever they dig, they leave the land well tilled for planting. The land is ready to plant delicious vegetables."�The Dugtrio are triplets that came out of the same body, that's why they think in the same way. When it comes to digging, they work as a team and tirelessly."�It retracts its sharp nails into its paws and sneaks around. So it goes unnoticed. It is not known why, but he loves shiny coins that shine in the light."�It has six striking whiskers that give it a ferocious appearance and help it detect any threat. If he is grabbed by the whiskers, he becomes docile."�When his headache increases, he begins to use strange powers. However, since he never remembers them, he always looks dazed and bewildered."~He is an expert swimmer. Sometimes he trains with professional swimmers. When his forehead glows, he uses psychic powers."�If he begins to tremble and breathe in an agitated way, he is going to get angry. Although anticipating his anger is useless because it comes so fast that there is no time to flee."yWhen Primeape gets angry, his heart rate increases and his muscles get stronger, but he also loses his intelligence."�He has an exceptional sense of smell and a great sensitive memory: he never forgets a scent and can even identify the emotions of other living beings."�He is known for his speed. They say that he is capable of running 10,000 km in 24 hours. The fire that burns vigorously within it is its source of energy."�It has a very thin skin that reveals the spiral viscera it has. Now, this skin has the advantage of being flexible, so it bounces back more than once."�His skin is moist and lubricated with an oily fluid. Thanks to this fatty film, he can escape from the clutches of any rival in full combat."�He has beefy, developed muscles that never tire no matter how hard he uses them. Crossing the Pacific Ocean a couple of times is effortless."{It is a Pokémon that sleeps 18 hours a day. It has been shown that every hour he uses teleportation to change places."�They say that a boy who had psychic abilities was suddenly transformed into Kadabra while helping in a study on extrasensory powers."�Although he has great psychic ability and exceptional intelligence, Alakazam's musculature is very weak. To move, she uses psychic powers."�He trains to exhaustion to master all kinds of martial arts. He is so strong that he can carry a sumo wrestler on his shoulders."zMachoke wears a belt to control his overwhelming energy. Since he is so dangerous, no one has ever taken it from him."�It is impossible to defend against the punches and blows that he distributes with the four arms that he has. If a strong rival appears, he gets a huge desire to fight."�It has a slim and flexible body that allows it to lean and sway to avoid attacks. It spits out a corrosive fluid that melts even iron."�It has a hook as a rear upper extremity that it uses at night to hang from a branch and sleep. If it moves while sleeping, it can end up on the floor."�He has a vine growing out of his head. When he shakes and tails her, she resembles an animal and thus manages to attract its prey. If a rival approaches her, she gobbles them up."�It is made up almost entirely of water. It grabs its enemy with its two long tentacles and stabs them with poisonous stingers at the ends."�It lives in complex rock formations on the ocean floor and grabs its prey using its 80 tentacles. If he gets nervous, the red spheres on his head glow."�Climb mountain paths using only the strength of your arms. As it looks like a rounded stone that delimits the path, some mountaineers come to trip over it."~Go down the mountains rolling down steep slopes. It is so robust that it destroys trees and boulders on impact with them."�They say that it lives in volcanic craters located on high peaks. Once a year, it sheds its skin and grows. The moult breaks down and is absorbed by the soil."�At birth, he is very weak and can barely stand up. However, she gets stronger by tripping and falling in her attempt to follow her parents."�It usually trots aimlessly through fields and plains. But if he has to go somewhere, the fire in his manes flares up and he goes into a flaming gallop reaching 150 miles per hour."�With its tail, it catches its rival by putting it under water on the banks of rivers. He often forgets what he was doing and spends entire days lounging on the shore."�It carries a Shellder attached to its tail by its teeth. Since Slowbro cannot fish with its tail, it reluctantly wades into the water in search of its prey."iLimb units are long range magnets. They generate enough magnetism to attract iron objects 100m away."�They are three Magnemite that attract each other. It generates powerful radio waves that cause the temperature to rise 2 degrees Celsius in a radius of 1 km."�Always carry a kind of stick of some kind of plant and they say that this can be better or worse. It is reputed to have battled other Pokémon for some stick."�Even while eating or sleeping, one of the heads is still on guard to detect any danger. If threatened, he runs away at 100 km per hour."�It belongs to a rare species of Pokémon that has three heads. Run energetically across green meadows even in dry seasons with very little rain."�It looks for its prey in icy waters, under the ice caps. When he needs to breathe, he punches a hole in the ice with the bulge on his head."pHe loves to doze on the cold ice. Once, a sailor who saw him asleep on a glacier mistook him for a mermaid."�Born from the polluted mud of the sea, Grimer's favorite food is garbage. It feeds on what it finds in the wastewater from factories."�It prefers warm and humid habitats. In summer, the toxic substances it contains intensify and make it stink like rotting garbage."�At night, it uses its wide tongue to make a hole in the bottom of the sea where it can rest. When he sleeps, Shellder closes his shell, but leaves his tongue sticking out."�It can swim through the sea by swallowing water and expelling it through the conduit on the back. In the same way throws the skewers on the shell."�It has a lot of gaseous matter. When swept away by a gale it dwindles. They gather under the eaves of houses to shelter from the wind."�It is a dangerous Pokémon. If in the dark you see one hovering and beckoning to you, stay away. This Pokémon will try to lick you to steal your energy."sIf on a dark night you see your shadow suddenly come forward, you will actually be seeing Gengar posing as it."�He has a magnet in his brain that serves as a compass so he doesn