m detecting him when he is in a forest with lush vegetation."�When in the jungle, he possesses unparalleled strength. This Pokémon makes sure that trees and plants grow well. It regulates its body temperature with sunlight."�If attacked, it defends itself by spitting fireballs that it forms in its stomach. The Torchic have an aversion to the dark because it prevents them from seeing their surroundings."�Deliver up to ten kicks per second. He has such a strong fighting instinct that he doesn't stop fighting until the opponent gives up."�Learn martial arts in which punches and kicks are given. After several years, its feathers burn off and new, very flexible ones grow in their place."yOn dry land, it can lift large boulders by leveraging its four legs. It sleeps buried in the ground, near the water."�It has very strong hind legs that allow it to stand upright. Since he weakens if his skin dries out, he plays in the mud to stay hydrated."�If it detects that a storm is approaching, it protects its nest by piling up boulders to protect it from strong waves. Swim as fast as a jet ski."�It threatens the enemy by violently showing its fangs. He chases his prey when he runs away, but if attacked, he runs away at full speed."�Mightyena lives with her pack in the wild. She always obeys his trainer. She defeats the enemy thanks to perfectly coordinated teamwork."�It always moves back and forth rubbing its nose against the ground in search of something. It is easy to identify it by the zigzag tracks it leaves behind."�It is tremendously fast if it runs in a straight line. When it detects its prey under the water of a pool, it makes a quick jump and catches it with its sharp claws."�It perches on tree branches and eats leaves. The thread that it spits out of its mouth solidifies on contact with the air and slows the enemy's movements."�He prepares for evolution using the energy he stored while he was a Wurmple. The two eyes that he has serve him to watch what happens 