nother trainer."�Electrifies the battle ground for five turns. Pokémon on the ground cannot be put to sleep and their electric-type moves increase in power by 50%."sCauses damage and has no side effects. In double or triple combats it hits all opponents adjacent to the user."4Pokémon congratulates you on your special day!"AThe user and an ally hold hands. This makes them very happy."QDecreases the target's attack by one level. It is a high priority move (+1)."3Causes damage and always paralyzes the target."ECauses damage and always leaves the opponent with at least 1 HP."|Causes damage and traps the opponent, subtracting 1/8 of the maximum HP during each turn until released. Lasts 4 to 5 turns."DCauses damage and always raises the user's attack by one level."]Causes damage and the user recovers 75% of the HP removed by the movement to the target."HAlthough it is an earth-type move, it affects flying-type Pokémon."NCauses damage and traps the target as long as the user remains in combat.",It causes harm and has no side effects."lCauses damage and the user receives recoil damage equal to half of the HP subtracted from the opponent."5Executes the power of water to attack the enemy."9Executes the power of the earth to attack the enemy."tIt is launched against the enemy at high speed, but lowers the user's Defense and Special Defense by one level."PCCauses damage, but lowers the user's defense by one level after execution."QThe user crashes into the target at high speed. This move always goes first."�The user charges the move at the beginning of a turn and executes it at the end of the same turn. If hit before, the enemy is burned."SThe user swings his body violently to inflict damage to everything around him."DIf used when the user is frozen, it will automatically defrost."It rubs the scales all over its body and makes a big noise to attack the opponent Pokémon, but lowers the user's Defense."KA powerful lightning bolt representing Zygarde firing at the opponent."[Causes damage without applying effects on changes in the target's evasion and defense."PThe user uses his body as a hammer to attack the target and inflict damage."]The user hits the target with a fiery lash. This also reduces the target's Defense stat."PConceals a great power, only works on the first turn the user is in battle."ECauses damage, but lowers the user's special attack by 2 levels."BCauses the selected target to recover half of its maximum HP."nRaises the Attack and Special Attack of the user and allied Pokémon that have the ability plus or minus."?The user fiercely attacks the target with his entire body."hFocuses his energy on his fist, coating it with ice to attack. However, it lowers the user's speed."EForces the target to immediately repeat the last move performed."JThe user concentrates so that his next move is always a critical hit."9Throws a large number of sharp blades at the target."\The user hits the target with a blast of water. It can also lower the target's Defense.".Attacks the enemy and reduces its Attack."]The user emits a sinister ray to attack the target. It will nullify the enemy's ability."|It causes damage and has no side effects. The type of this move changes according to the disk the Pokémon is equipped with."RThe user hits the target with the force of nature and removes half of its HP."oThe user attacks the enemy with a burst of pollen that explodes. If the target is an ally, it recovers HP."<The user counts on his strength and attacks the target.00"oMakes the combat terrain strange for five turns by making Pokémon unaffected by moves with high priority."QCures the target's status problems. If done, restores 50% of its maximum HP."lThe user attacks the target by dancing very hard. The type of the user determines the type of movement."FCauses damage and has a 20% chance to lower the target's Defense."xIf the user receives a physical category move during that turn, the shell explodes, severely damaging the opponent."LRecovers half of the user's maximum HP. Recovers more HP in sandstorms."KThe user stabs the target with a sharp horn. This attack never misses."iConcentrates solar energy in the first turn, to release a blade that causes damage in the next turn."HCauses damage and if the target was burned heals him from his burn."JSteals positive changes in the target's stats and then causes damage."7Switches the user's speed with that of the target."lCauses damage and traps the target, preventing it from fleeing or being exchanged for another Pokémon."RThe user becomes the target of all moves during the turn in which it is used."|Reduces the target's Attack and then restores an amount of HP to the user equal to the target's Attack before being reduced."^The user hits the target with the force of a meteor. It will nullify the enemy's ability."ALowers the target's Attack and Special Attack. Never misses."JThe user hits the opponent with his forearms. It is usually critical."YThe user shoots toxic threads to poison the target and slow down the target's speed."eThe user kicks with the force of nature against the target. It also reduces the target's Attack."DCauses damage and has a 30% chance of knocking the target back."WProtects the user from all movements during the turn it is used, including damage."~Driven by frustration, the user attacks the target. If the user's previous move has failed, the power of this move is doubled."lCauses damage and traps the target, preventing it from fleeing or being exchanged for another Pokémon."mThis move reduces the damage of physical and special moves for five turns, but can only be used on hail."(It has no effect. It only splashes."(It has no effect. It only splashes.0"`In reality its power is 500. The user releases a magical nuclear explosion and is weakened."oIncreases its power x1.5 if Anchor has been used before (not cumulative) and increases attack and defense."*Lightning that can burn the opponent."YPuts the opponent to sleep for 2 turns if the user receives damage during that turn."USORE GA CHIGAU YOOO. Decreases the enemy's Def. and Def.Esp. by 2 levels if hit."FSpend $1000. Fails if there is no money. Random power and effect."Rowlet's final attack."_It attacks the opponent by leaving behind absorbent cotton behind him, reducing his speed."RAfter attacking, it rushes back to make way for another Pokémon on the team.[�0"
